- The ARR Reviewer Guidelines: http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewerguidelines\n- The review form link is available at: http://aclrollingreview.org/cfp\n- The official EMNLP 2026 Main Conference call for papers: https://2026.emnlp.org/calls/main_conference_papers/"],"durationSeconds":6.183963695000002}}
