{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DmPk48w7sDGZ6KDvnivZyN","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 struct_self_consist_ie 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (114 个)\\n\\n- **exp_002_ner_conll2003**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_004_re_diagnostic**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_005**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_014_entity_majority_voting**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_013_exact_match_voting**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp_012_logprob_baseline**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_pilot_005**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **e1_component_wise_re_sj**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_pilot_004**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **ft_002_v2**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_pilot_002**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **ft_002**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **ft_001**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_pilot_003**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_pilot_001**: DONE (negative) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-16\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| exp_022_seed789 | 3rd seed SciERC inference (seed=789) with ft_002_v2 (Qwen3-8B). N=8, T=1.0, joint NER+RE, logprobs collected. Complements seed42 (exp_012_rerun_1024) and seed123/456 for multi-seed analysis. | — | — | — |\\n| exp_020_fewnerd_smoke | 1-epoch LoRA (r16) fine-tune Qwen3-8B on Few-NERD INTRA coarse 8-type (131k train), then N=8 T=1.0 pilot inference on 200 test instances. Re-started training 2026-05-16 18:29 CST on cuda:1, PID 288683. ETA ~22:55 CST. | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n（无）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **exp_023_lora_rank8** (success): —\\n- **exp_vc_lp_cascade_selection** (killed): VC-filtered LP selection cascade: test if combining VC (pre-filter) + LP (rank) improves selection F1 over single-signal selection. Addresses SF3 reviewer suggestion. Pure analysis on existing data.\\n- **exp_tacred_re_benchmark** (killed): TACRED RE benchmark: replicate SciERC RE experiment flow on second RE dataset. Verify correlation-selection gap generalizes