ant utility scores\\\\n  type: quantitative\\\\n  evidence: Q1 within-instance analysis\\\\n  decisions: []\\\\n  deprecated: false\\\\n- id: C035\\\\n  location:\\\\n    section: sections/discussion\\\\n    paragraph: 0\\\\n    sentence: 0\\\\n  text: SJ median within-instance rho = 0.524 on SciERC\\\\n  type: quantitative\\\\n  evidence: Q1 within-instance analysis\\\\n  decisions: []\\\\n  deprecated: false\\\\n- id: C036\\\\n  location:\\\\n    section: sections/discussion\\\\n    paragraph: 0\\\\n    sentence: 0\\\\n  text: SJ median within-instance rho = 0.994 on CoNLL\\\\n  type: quantitative\\\\n  evidence: Q1 within-instance analysis\\\\n  decisions: []\\\\n  deprecated: false\\\\n- id: C037\\\\n  location:\\\\n    section: sections/discussion\\\\n    paragraph: 0\\\\n    sentence: 0\\\\n  text: MBR closes 23% of oracle gap on non-degenerate SciERC instances\\\\n  type: quantitative\\\\n  evidence: Q1 within-instance analysis\\\\n  decisions: []\\\\n  deprecated: false\\\\n- id: C038\\\\n  location:\\\\n    section: sections/discussion\\\\n    paragraph: 0\\\\n    sentence: 0\\\\n  text: MBR closes 41% of oracle gap on non-degenerate CoNLL instances\\\\n  type: quantitative\\\\n  evidence: Q1 within-instance analysis\\\\n  decisions: []\\\\n  deprecated: false\\\\n- id: C039\\\\n  location:\\\\n    section: sections/discussion\\\\n    paragraph: 0\\\\n    sentence: 0\\\\n  text: Greedy T=0 achieves F1=0.663 on SciERC, surpassing all N=8 selection strategies\\\\n  type: quantitative\\\\n  evidence: SF4 greedy data\\\\n  decisions: []\\\\n  deprecated: false\\\\ntables:\\\\n- id: tab:notation\\\\n  section: method\\\\n  caption: Notation used throughout the paper\\\\n  evidence: []\\\\n  note: Notation table—no experimental data.\\\\n- id: tab:quality_estimation\\\\n  section: experiments\\\\n  caption: Quality estimation across tasks and models (Spearman ρ and AUROC)\\\\n  evidence:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_012_rerun_1024\\\\n    role: SciERC NER ρ values (N=8, Q